p: .
t. 
|  In fact, in many cases, CPS removal petitions are sworn to by someone other than the caseworkers who investigate the facts - almost as if
|  CPS officials want to ensure that those who sign can always claim ignorance of the truth if a rare family court judge actually holds them to the
.  requirements of perjury statutes


--- Sentence/switch
