p: .
t. 
|  Is someone watching them at literally all times? Are they dirty? If CPS
|  can make it appear, from such interviews, that there is any possibility of
|  sustaining a child abuse or neglect charge, the illegality of the original
.  removal will generally be overlooked

--- Sentence/end 
